+Section 4 of v1 is binding. Exact approval must use task, action, ceiling, frozen tree, expiry, evidence and plan-line ID. Missing percentage means the current **30%**, never a raised default (`FAST_TRACK_PLAN_v1.md:89-96`; `LEVER_RULES_v3.md` 1C). “No core → park” needs an exact plan line because `AUTO_POLICY.md:29` currently says never park. “Above gate → harden once” remains Needs Ayush. QC minor/warning may be noted for QL only under the exact approved condition, with the real QC verdict preserved. Manual paid-run authority starts only **after QC PASS and freeze**, within the day's cap, with Ayush told and the decision logged; `AUTO_POLICY.md:26,51-53` already pins the auto-side conditions. v2 adds an explicit manual preflight. Full QC always runs its full Step 10; reuse is recheck-only (`P11_full_qc_v3.md:29-35`). No paid result is ever reused (`AUTO_POLICY.md:28-29`).
