+
+## 6. Order, dependencies and missing gates
+
+D1 must precede D6 because `Paid runs:` is parsed loosely (`auto.py:498-500`). D5 must precede D4 because raw jobs now disappear under `/tmp` (`RECHECK_FIX.md:108-122`). Dockslot must precede a production lane increase; the same-tree 1/3/4 benchmark needs empty Docker (`MEASURE.md:208-210`). **Correction:** D2 integration should remain FIFO and keep MQ flock and external Harbor accounting; priority/backfill would be a separate behavior change, not part of this fast track. D5 must include worker permissions and Docker file sharing before any worker switches. D6's manual paid-run preflight must precede its new permission.
+
+Missing gates: migrate old free-form `Paid runs:` plans; add tests for exact/no-cap/duplicate line, D6 scopes, notify sound, dockslot dead lease and double-counting, D4 incomplete/mismatched results, and path permissions; run harness pytest in its virtual environment when permitted; snapshot old policy/templates, update `prompts/templates/CHANGELOG.md` and rule fingerprints/hash manifests; document rollback per component, without reverting active work. Switch on between runs, after smoke under real loopback/Docker permissions. The v1 “all three suites green” cannot be claimed from this sandbox (section 4).
+
+### Every wrong or missing item and fix
+
+| Item | Required fix in v2 |
+|---|---|
+| D6 popup/authority | Include master-hold caller, add sound and audited manual paid-run preflight. |
+| D2 process visibility | Preserve current external Harbor detection; cover arbitrary worker Docker. |
+| F2 existing safeguards | Extend P12 G1–G7 rather than replacing or describing them as absent. |
+| D4 raw evidence/stub | Persist manifest and stub; refuse incomplete reuse. |
+| D5 permissions/sharing | Narrow WORKER_PERMISSION allowlist and mount proof before move. |
+| A5 impossible static guarantee | Numeric attestation and warning tier; avoid false path refusals. |
+| Kit x5 vs reuse | Label exception and settle paid-run readiness (question 1). |
+| Timing/12h promise | State hypotheses, measure matched pilots. |
+| Test gate | Fix stale fixtures, run pytest suite, get real loopback/Docker smoke before release. |
