+VERDICT: PASS WITH FIXES
+
+# V3 fast-track verification — 31 Oct 2026
+
+Scope: read-only inspection of the live tree and saved logs. `FAST_TRACK_PLAN_v1.md` is a plan, not deployed. Paths below are relative to `/Users/mac/Desktop/Terminal Bench/` unless absolute. RIGHT means the factual claim is supported, not that its proposed change is safe.
